  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">#CoCreateDesign Festival 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the #CoCreateDesign Festival 2018 is to provide a platform for local and Dutch businesses to identify obstacles and opportunities. This purpose will be achieved by creating a location and event space in Cape Town for exchanging ideas using the design thinking methodology in the water, mobility, and agri-food sectors, which are essential Dutch sectors for South Africa. The festival aims to promote Dutch design thinking as essential to facilitating change and solutions in the above-mentioned areas for local problem-solving. It also intends to support entrepreneurship in the creative industries by tapping into their vision and creativity. Lastly, the festival will create a report with observations and challenges to work out the pilot for next year&apos;s event.</narrative>
  </description>
